tatami-convndx(8)

# NAME

tatami convndx - convert v2 indexes to v3 format

# SYNOPSIS

*tatami convndx* _indexes_...

# DESCRIPTION

*tatami convndx* reads the specified _indexes_ and generates and merges them.
The resulting data is written out to stdout in tatami v3 index format.

# OPTIONS

*tatami convndx* does not support any specific options. See *tatami*(8) for global
options.
